#: scripts/scenario_34_locust_swarm.lua:2760
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"Hello %s,\n"
"Our sensors have picked up numerous Exuari ships."
msgstr ""
"Bonjour équipage du %s,\n"
"Nos capteurs viennent de détecter de nombreux vaisseaux Éxuaris."

#: scripts/scenario_34_locust_swarm.lua:2765
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "How many is numerous?"
msgstr "Qu'entendez-vous par \"nombreux\" ?"

#: scripts/scenario_34_locust_swarm.lua:2767
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Approximately %s"
msgstr "Environ %s."

#: scripts/scenario_34_locust_swarm.lua:2770
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "That's quite a few. What kind of ships?"
msgstr "Cela fait un certain nombre. Quel genre de vaisseaux ?"

#: scripts/scenario_34_locust_swarm.lua:2776
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "They look like %ss. The computer calls them locusts. They're very fast."
msgstr ""
"Ils ressemblent à des %ss. L'ordinateur les appelle des sauterelles. Ils "
"sont très rapides."

#: scripts/scenario_34_locust_swarm.lua:2782
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Should we be worried?"
msgstr "Faut-il s'inquiéter ?"

#: scripts/scenario_34_locust_swarm.lua:2787
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"Individually, they should be easy to handle. As a group, they could be a "
"problem."
msgstr ""
"Individuellement, ils devraient être faciles à gérer. Mais en groupe, ils "
"pourraient poser problème."

#: scripts/scenario_34_locust_swarm.lua:2793
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "What do you want us to do about them?"
msgstr "Que voulez-vous que l'on fasse les concernant ?"

#: scripts/scenario_34_locust_swarm.lua:2799
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Get rid of them. Every last one of them."
msgstr "Vous débarrasser d'eux. De chacun d’entre eux."

#: scripts/scenario_34_locust_swarm.lua:2819
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"Greetings %s,\n"
"We've got an update for you on those Exuari Locusts."
msgstr ""
"Salutations équipage du %s,\n"
"Nous avons une information de dernière minute pour vous concernant ces "
"sauterelles Éxuaries."

#: scripts/scenario_34_locust_swarm.lua:2824
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Tell us about it."
msgstr "Nous vous écoutons"

#: scripts/scenario_34_locust_swarm.lua:2828
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "All the Exuari on our sensors have started moving."
msgstr "Tous les vaisseaux Éxuaris sur nos capteurs ont commencé à bouger."

#: scripts/scenario_34_locust_swarm.lua:2831
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Where are they going?"
msgstr "Où vont-ils ?"

#: scripts/scenario_34_locust_swarm.lua:2835
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"We are not quite sure, but they seem to be converging on a central location."
msgstr ""
"Nous n’en sommes pas sûrs, mais ils semblent converger vers une position "
"centrale."

#: scripts/scenario_34_locust_swarm.lua:2841
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "That could make it harder for us to get rid of them."
msgstr "Ça peut nous rendre la tâche plus difficile"

#: scripts/scenario_34_locust_swarm.lua:2847
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"How perceptive of you! We are so glad you are out there working to rid us of "
"these Locusts. Keep up the good work!"
msgstr ""
"Comme c'est perspicace de votre part !\n"
"Nous sommes ravi que vous œuvriez pour nous débarrasser de ces sauterelles. "
"Continuez votre bon travail !"

#: scripts/scenario_34_locust_swarm.lua:3057
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid "Scenario needs the 'Per-system damage' option under 'Extra settings'"
msgstr ""
"Le scénario nécessite l'option \"Dégâts par systèmes\" située dans le menu "
"\"Réglages : scan, fréquences, piratage…\""

